If you want the ultimately easy to complete nethack, heres a really
annoying spoiler...



First, get yourself a few food rations. A pick axe helps here but if you dont
have one, dont worry, one will jus walk up to you soon enuff. Whatever you do
DONT GET INTRINSIC INVISIBILITY, and DONT wear a cloak of invis. Now sit on
your alter and type 100. and keep doin it till monsters come to get you. Kill
em all and offer all the corpses that you find. Once you get the message "You
have a feeling of reconciliation" feel free to eat any corpses that give
you intrinsics, but make sure that youve had that message (it means your luck
is above zero *I THINK*) and offer the rest to boost your luck. Now the
problem, when youve killed loads of orcy types youll have lots and lots of
crap about, so you dig a pit in the cornr of the room, and pick up lots of
crap and fall thru. You can build a great pollypile this way by piling up all
the blessed armor, tools scrolls, wands,rings,and rocks(they slow down the
count too) togeather. Dump the crap an go back to the alter.

After a while you'll start recieving weapons from ya god. Then Hit points
(a golden glow is +5 hp) spellbooks an blessings. Then there's gifts of
intrinsic speed, stealth and protection (which stacks, -4AC first time, and
another -1 each subsequant time. A mate once took it to the extriem and had
12 gifts of protection).

Extra stuff: Hand of Aroich and Elbereth both have the same effect. They take
